<div class="arcade" data-unit-arcade>
 <div class="arcade-head"><p class="eyebrow">PATTERN MACHINE MISSION</p><h3>Operate five control modules</h3><p>Build, calculate, graph, and balance. Correct mathematics unlocks the final control room; there is no timer.</p><div class="power" role="progressbar" aria-label="Modules restored" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="5" aria-valuenow="0" data-power-track><span data-power style="width:0%"></span></div><strong data-power-label>0 / 5 modules restored</strong></div>
 <div class="missions">
  <fieldset data-mission="digit"><legend><span>1</span><b>Shipment Code Builder</b> Complete 42□3 so it is divisible by 9.</legend><div class="machine-display">42 <label><span class="sr-only">Missing digit</span><input type="number" min="0" max="9" step="1" data-digit /></label> 3</div><button type="button" data-test>Test code</button><p data-feedback role="status">Use the digit sum and find every valid digit.</p></fieldset>
  <fieldset data-mission="pattern"><legend><span>2</span><b>Light Pattern Generator</b> The display grows 5, 9, 13, 17. Build its rule.</legend><div class="tile-strip" aria-label="Figures have 5, 9, 13, and 17 lights"><i style="--n:5"></i><i style="--n:9"></i><i style="--n:13"></i><i style="--n:17"></i></div><div class="rule-builder"><label>Coefficient<select data-coefficient><option>2</option><option>3</option><option>4</option><option>5</option></select></label><b>n +</b><label>Fixed part<select data-constant><option>0</option><option>1</option><option>4</option><option>5</option></select></label></div><button type="button" data-test>Test rule</button><p data-feedback role="status">Separate the growth from the fixed part.</p></fieldset>
  <fieldset data-mission="table"><legend><span>3</span><b>Table Control Panel</b> Complete y=3x+2.</legend><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">x</th><th scope="col">y</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">0</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">2</th><td><label><span class="sr-only">Output for x equals 2</span><input type="number" data-table-a /></label></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">5</th><td><label><span class="sr-only">Output for x equals 5</span><input type="number" data-table-b /></label></td></tr></tbody></table><button type="button" data-test>Test table</button><p data-feedback role="status">Substitute each input into the same rule.</p></fieldset>
  <fieldset data-mission="graph"><legend><span>4</span><b>Graph Console</b> Identify the relation shown by the discrete points.</legend><svg viewBox="0 0 260 220" role="img" aria-label="Discrete graph with points 0 comma 2, 1 comma 5, 2 comma 8, and 3 comma 11. Horizontal axis x from 0 to 4 by 1. Vertical axis y from 0 to 12 by 2."><line class="axis" x1="34" y1="184" x2="238" y2="184"/><line class="axis" x1="34" y1="190" x2="34" y2="16"/>{[0,1,2,3,4].map(i=><><line x1={34+i*45} y1="180" x2={34+i*45} y2="188"/><text x={34+i*45} y="205" text-anchor="middle">{i}</text></>)}{[0,2,4,6,8,10,12].map((v,i)=><><line x1="30" y1={184-i*26} x2="38" y2={184-i*26}/><text x="25" y={188-i*26} text-anchor="end">{v}</text></>)}{[[0,2],[1,5],[2,8],[3,11]].map(([x,y])=><circle cx={34+x*45} cy={184-y*13} r="6"/>)}<text x="135" y="218" text-anchor="middle">Input x</text><text x="205" y="22">Output y</text></svg><div class="graph-options"><label><input type="radio" name="arcade-graph" value="0"/> y=2x+3</label><label><input type="radio" name="arcade-graph" value="1"/> y=3x+2</label><label><input type="radio" name="arcade-graph" value="2"/> y=5x</label></div><button type="button" data-test>Test graph</button><p data-feedback role="status">Use two points, not only the graph’s appearance.</p></fieldset>
  <fieldset data-mission="balance"><legend><span>5</span><b>Packing Balance</b> Repair 4x=36 while preserving equality.</legend><div class="balance-visual" aria-label="Four equal x groups balance 36 units"><span>x</span><span>x</span><span>x</span><span>x</span><b>= 36</b></div><div class="balance-inputs"><label>Operation on both sides<select data-balance-operation><option value="subtract">Subtract 4</option><option value="divide">Divide by 4</option><option value="multiply">Multiply by 4</option></select></label><label>Value of x<input type="number" data-balance-x /></label></div><button type="button" data-test>Test balance</button><p data-feedback role="status">Use the inverse operation on both sides.</p></fieldset>
 </div>
 <div class="control-room" data-control-room hidden tabindex="-1"><p class="eyebrow">FINAL CONTROL ROOM</p><h3>Connect one rule across three representations.</h3><p>The restored machine uses y=4x+3 and reports an output of 23.</p><div class="final-grid"><label>Input in the matching table row<input type="number" data-final-input /></label><label>Matching graph point<input type="text" data-final-point placeholder="(x, y)" /></label><label>Solution of 4x+3=23<input type="number" data-final-solution /></label></div><label class="final-explanation">Explain how your table value verifies both the graph point and equation.<textarea rows="4" data-final placeholder="The table shows… This point… Both sides…"></textarea></label><button type="button" data-final-check>Send recommendation</button><p data-final-feedback role="status">All three representations must agree.</p></div>
</div>
<script>
 document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-unit-arcade]').forEach(root=>{const missions=[...root.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-mission]')];let unlocked=false;const message=(item:HTMLElement,ok:boolean,success:string,repair:string)=>{item.dataset.complete=String(ok);item.classList.toggle('restored',ok);const feedback=item.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-feedback]');if(feedback)feedback.innerHTML=`<strong>${ok?'Module restored.':'Signal mismatch.'}</strong> ${ok?success:repair}`};const update=()=>{const complete=missions.filter(x=>x.dataset.complete==='true').length;const power=root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-power]');if(power)power.style.width=`${complete/5*100}%`;root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-power-track]')?.setAttribute('aria-valuenow',String(complete));const label=root.querySelector('[data-power-label]');if(label)label.textContent=`${complete} / 5 modules restored`;const room=root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-control-room]');if(room){room.hidden=complete<5;if(complete===5&&!unlocked){unlocked=true;room.focus()}}};missions.forEach(item=>item.querySelector('[data-test]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{const kind=item.dataset.mission||'';let ok=false,success='',repair='';if(kind==='digit'){const value=Number(item.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('[data-digit]')?.value);ok=value===0||value===9;success=`The digit sum is ${9+value}, a multiple of 9. Both 0 and 9 are valid.`;repair='The known digits total 9. The missing digit must keep the total a multiple of 9.'}if(kind==='pattern'){const a=Number(item.querySelector<HTMLSelectElement>('[data-coefficient]')?.value),b=Number(item.querySelector<HTMLSelectElement>('[data-constant]')?.value);ok=a===4&&b===1;success='The change is 4, and 4(1)+1=5, so the rule is 4n+1.';repair='The constant change becomes the coefficient. Test n=1 to find the fixed part.'}if(kind==='table'){const a=Number(item.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('[data-table-a]')?.value),b=Number(item.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('[data-table-b]')?.value);ok=a===8&&b===17;success='The completed pairs are (2,8) and (5,17).';repair='Calculate 3(2)+2 and 3(5)+2.'}if(kind==='graph'){const chosen=item.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('input:checked');ok=chosen?.value==='1';success='The points rise 3 for every 1 across and begin at 2, so y=3x+2.';repair='Compare (0,2) with another point and test the proposed rule.'}if(kind==='balance'){const operation=item.querySelector<HTMLSelectElement>('[data-balance-operation]')?.value,x=Number(item.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('[data-balance-x]')?.value);ok=operation==='divide'&&x===9;success='Dividing both sides by 4 gives x=9; 4(9)=36 verifies it.';repair='Undo multiplication by 4 using the same operation on both sides.'}message(item,ok,success,repair);update()}));root.querySelector('[data-final-check]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{const input=Number(root.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('[data-final-input]')?.value),point=(root.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('[data-final-point]')?.value||'').replace(/\s/g,''),solution=Number(root.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('[data-final-solution]')?.value),explanation=(root.querySelector<HTMLTextAreaElement>('[data-final]')?.value||'').trim(),connected=explanation.length>=60&&/(because|shows|so|therefore|same|equal)/i.test(explanation),ok=input===5&&/^\(?5,23\)?$/.test(point)&&solution===5&&connected;const feedback=root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-final-feedback]');if(feedback)feedback.innerHTML=ok?'<strong>Mission complete.</strong> Input 5 gives output 23, point (5,23), and solution x=5. Your explanation connects the evidence.':'<strong>Control room not cleared yet.</strong> Verify the input, write the ordered pair, solve the equation, and explain why all three represent the same relation.'});update()});
</script>
<style>
.arcade{border-radius:17px;overflow:hidden;background:#17152e;color:#fff}.arcade-head{padding:1.2rem;background:radial-gradient(circle at top right,#3f3c85,#17152e 60%)}.arcade-head h3{font-size:1.7rem;margin:.2rem 0}.power{height:12px;margin-top:1rem;border-radius:99px;background:#ffffff1c;overflow:hidden}.power span{display:block;height:100%;background:#76e0b7;transition:width .25s}.missions{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.8rem;padding:1rem}.missions fieldset{display:grid;gap:.65rem;border:1px solid #ffffff24;border-radius:13px;padding:1rem;background:#ffffff0b}.missions legend{display:grid;gap:.2rem;font-weight:700}.missions legend span{display:grid;place-items:center;width:1.7rem;height:1.7rem;border-radius:99px;background:#6d64d8}.missions button,.control-room button{justify-self:start;border:0;border-radius:8px;padding:.6rem .8rem;background:#f4c95d;color:#17152e;font-weight:900}.missions fieldset.restored{border-color:#76e0b7;background:#123d35}.missions p{padding:.55rem;border-radius:8px;background:#00000024}.machine-display{font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:900}.machine-display input,.missions td input,.balance-inputs input,.final-grid input{width:5rem;font:inherit;padding:.45rem;border-radius:7px}.rule-builder,.balance-inputs,.final-grid{display:flex;gap:.55rem;align-items:end;flex-wrap:wrap}.rule-builder label,.balance-inputs label,.final-grid label{display:grid;gap:.3rem}.rule-builder select,.balance-inputs select{font:inherit;padding:.45rem;border-radius:7px}.tile-strip{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:.35rem}.tile-strip i{display:block;height:28px;border-radius:6px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,#76e0b7 0 8px,transparent 8px 11px);background-size:calc(var(--n)*11px) 100%;border:1px solid #ffffff38}.missions table{border-collapse:collapse;color:#17152e;background:#fff}.missions th,.missions td{padding:.45rem;border:1px solid #aaa;text-align:center}.missions svg{width:100%;max-width:390px;border-radius:9px;background:#fff}.missions svg line{stroke:#667085}.missions svg .axis{stroke:#17152e;stroke-width:2}.missions svg text{fill:#17152e;font:700 12px system-ui}.missions svg circle{fill:#c64632}.graph-options{display:grid;gap:.4rem}.graph-options label{padding:.45rem;border-radius:7px;background:#ffffff0c}.balance-visual{display:flex;gap:.35rem;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:.8rem;border-bottom:5px solid #76e0b7}.balance-visual span{display:grid;place-items:center;width:40px;height:48px;border-radius:6px;background:#dbeafe;color:#17345c;font-weight:900}.control-room{margin:0 1rem 1rem;padding:1rem;border:1px solid #f4c95d;border-radius:13px;background:#28244a}.final-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}.final-explanation{display:grid;gap:.4rem;margin-top:.8rem;font-weight:800}.control-room textarea{font:inherit;padding:.7rem;border-radius:9px}.control-room button{margin-top:.8rem}.arcade button:focus-visible,.arcade input:focus-visible,.arcade textarea:focus-visible,.arcade select:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #76e0b7;outline-offset:2px}.sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0);white-space:nowrap;border:0}@media(max-width:700px){.missions,.final-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.rule-builder,.balance-inputs{align-items:stretch;flex-direction:column}.missions input,.missions select{min-height:44px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.power span{transition:none}}
</style>
